      "content": "Evaluation Method Overview table: Item = Infrared No-Touch Forehead Thermometer; Influencing factors = Frequency, use time, ambient temperature and humidity; Model = PT9L; Attribute = independent research and development; Decomposition relation type = No replaceable parts; During the Expected Life / failure rate = 5 years; Evaluation methodology = Accelerated life testing report (see Annex I); Evaluation completion unit = ANDON HEALTH CO., LTD.; Whether an unacceptable risk occurs during the Expected Life = No (See Risk Analysis Report for details).",
